      "content": "hey, just wanted to run something by u before the sync meeting tomorrow. i've been looking at the cloudconnect api and the legacy sql stuff... honestly, i think we can actually skip the middleware layer entirely and just do a direct integration. i've been playing around with the config and it looks like we can just map the calls directly if we use a custom header injection",
